flowchart TD
    A[SOC observes issue] --> B[SOC analyses data]
    B --> C[SOC proposes change]
    C --> D[Risk of change explained]
    D --> E[Client / owner reviews]
    E --> F{GO or NO GO}
    F -->|GO| G[Implement change]
    G --> H[Validate change]
    H --> I[Monitor]
    F -->|NO GO| J[Document decision]
    J --> K[Retain or adjust detection]
    K --> L[Apply compensating control if required]
